<view class="page"><view class="row"><text class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE WEEKENDS</text><text class="link" bindtap="profile">家庭资料 ›</text></view><view class="title">周末，有约啦。</view><view class="sub">{{profile.nickname || '新朋友'}}，把一起玩的时光留在这里。</view><view class="filters"><view class="chip {{filter===item?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</view></view>
<view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="badge">{{item.state}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.owned?'我发起的':'我参加的'}}</text></view><view class="card-title">{{item.symbol}} {{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.date}} {{item.time}} · {{item.count}} 个家庭</view><view class="meta">{{item.location}}</view><view class="divider"/><text class="link">查看约玩安排 ›</text></view>
<view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!items.length}}"><view class="empty-icon">🗓️</view><view class="card-title">这页快乐，等你来写</view><view class="sub">去发现一个想参加的活动吧。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="discover">发现约玩</button></view><view class="footer-note">本地体验版 · 暂不发送微信提醒</view></view>
